{"id":"825a5c734b53fa73","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-nce-boolean-bounds.md","title":"有限心变的并交与补集上界","display":"thm-nce-boolean-bounds — 有限心变的并交与补集上界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-nce-boolean-bounds","aliases":["20-thm-nce-boolean-bounds"],"display":"thm-nce-boolean-bounds — 有限心变的并交与补集上界","chapter":"3","section":"3.8.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 3.8.6 的直接推论","source_printed_pages":[75,76],"source_pdf_pages":[111,112],"depends_on":["[[20-df-nce]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-nce-boolean-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-nce-boolean-bounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nce-boolean-bounds — 有限心变的并交与补集上界"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.8.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.8.6 的直接推论"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span><span>112</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nCE}(A,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{nCE}(A,n)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nCE}(B,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{nCE}(B,m)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nce-boolean-bounds}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{nCE}(A\\cup B,n+m)\\land\\operatorname{nCE}(A\\cap B,n+m)\\land\n\\operatorname{nCE}(\\omega\\setminus A,n+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nce-boolean-bounds}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{nCE}(A\\cup B,n+m)\\land\\operatorname{nCE}(A\\cap B,n+m)\\land\n\\operatorname{nCE}(\\omega\\setminus A,n+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>并、交分别用两个二值近似的 max、min；只有某个输入近似改变时结果才可能改变，故总变次数不超过和。补集近似先在阶段 0 取 0，阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-a(x,s)\">\\(1-a(x,s)\\)</span>，额外一次起始改变加原来的至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次。即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span>，空集的补集仍需一次起始改变，不能笼统断言同一 n 层在补集下封闭。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.8.6 的直接推论；印刷页 75, 76；PDF 第 111, 112 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-nce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-nce]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{nCE}(A,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nCE}(B,m)","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nce-boolean-bounds}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{nCE}(A\\cup B,n+m)\\land\\operatorname{nCE}(A\\cap B,n+m)\\land\n\\operatorname{nCE}(\\omega\\setminus A,n+1).","display":true},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"1-a(x,s)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":1363,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f6085a9e9511e00a"]}